  "readme.txt": "=== Fixture Theme ===\nRequires at least: 7.1\nRequires PHP: 8.2\nStable tag: 1.2.3\nLicense: GPL-2.0-or-later\n\nThe theme the unit suite builds.\n\n== Description ==\n\nA block theme built from TSX with @spacefast/zero-blocks. Templates, parts, patterns and theme.json are generated; edit the sources, not these files.\n",
